            <run fontcolor='#5a5f6e' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='11'>Estimates, not results: the real 2027 rents are not published yet. They assume the 2021–2025 average pace (+10.7% a year). Population filter starts at 20,000 residents (117 of 228 municipalities). Accuracy: see the Historical test tab.</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
